Subject: [202605] Complete AS7816 environmental monitoring

Backported from ITJamie/sonic-buildimage accton-fixes commit 45a93cbc9c69d0c346de84b9a27476e56d43a49a.
Verified target source: 5ef9e45ccf7f004fb07bf3f9be2f471cf00573bf.

Expose YM-2851F voltage/temperature limits and manufacturer output capacity;
retain only unsupported PSU fan target-speed exclusions. Use real PSU airflow,
add output voltage/current sensors, CPU coretemp and read-only BIOS inventory.
Input telemetry remains explicitly unsupported. The existing shared PDDF path
retry restores the original 52 percent fan policy after delayed registration.
Preserve the six board sensor indices, cooling policy and all SDK/port settings.
Includes earlier health/LED changes to these files so apply/reapply is reliable.

Upstream PR: https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-buildimage/pull/30780
Remove when the target branch provides equivalent fixes.

